      'Receiving re-averages unit cost when costing = weighted_average. Historical movement costs are never recalculated.',
      'Short receipts leave the PO open. Over-receipts are permitted but flagged and require a reason.',
      'Deleting an item is prohibited once it has movements. Archive instead.',
