      'Sum of payments may not exceed total minus credit notes.',
      'Recurring schedules must be idempotent per period: a retry never issues a duplicate invoice.',
      'Every screen beyond Invoices is a capability, and each is reached from the module\u2019s own rail \u2014 recurring, approvals, ageing and clients appear and disappear with their switch rather than living behind a permanent menu.',
