      'An age-restricted line cannot be tendered without an age check record. A refusal voids the line and is kept.',
      'Promotions are evaluated server-side at tender and snapshotted onto the order. A promotion ending mid-basket does not change a line already priced.',
      'Only one promotion applies to a line unless stackable is explicitly true. The applied promotion id is stored on the line.',
      'A markdown is a new price record with an expiry, never an edit to the item price. The original price returns automatically.',
      'Waste is a stock movement of kind waste with a reason and a snapshotted cost. It never reduces stock silently as an adjustment.',
      'Deposits are a liability account. A refunded deposit at the till must not appear as negative sales revenue.',
      'A gap order becomes an ordinary purchase order on send. There is no second ordering pipeline.',
      'A price change queues a label; the queue is never cleared automatically, because an unprinted label is a mispriced shelf.',
